px,5vw,24px);margin:4px 0;color:#ffab84}.intro,.help{max-width:580px;margin:8px auto;font-size:14px;line-height:1.35;color:#d6e4df}.stats{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0}.stats span{font-size:12px;background:#153047;border:1px solid #41627a;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 8px}.stats b{color:#9aefd3;margin-left:4px}.play{margin:auto;width:min(100%,650px)}canvas{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:.85;height:auto;background:#09192c;border:2px solid #365772;border-radius:14px;touch-action:none} [data-game-progress],[data-game-status]{font-size:12px;margin:6px}.controls{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:10px}button{font:700 14px system-ui;border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:10px 14px;background:#ff8d6d;color:#172537;cursor:pointer}button[data-game-start],button[data-game-restart]{background:#8ce0c7}.result h2{margin-top:14px}.result p{font-size:14px;margin:4px;color:#d8f6e7}[data-game-error]{color:#ff9c8b;font-size:14px}@media(min-width:800px){main{max-width:900px}.play{max-width:650px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*:before,*:after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}","path":"style.css"},{"content":"# Cloud Cargo

Cloud Cargo is an original stationary cargo-allocation practice puzzle. Each manifest presents shared cargo crates and several airship bays. Select a crate and assign it to a bay; all bay mass targets must match, and later manifests require energy totals too. Crates may always be reassigned.

## Controls

- **Keyboard:** Left/Right moves focus across crates and bays. Space selects a crate or assigns the selected crate to a focused bay.
- **Touch:** Tap a crate, then tap an airship bay.

Three deterministic manifests contain 4, 5, then 6 crates. The same seed restarts for mastery, while a normal new visit receives the GameKit seed. Load all three airships before the 50-second limit. Start Loading begins play; Pause and Play Again use the supplied GameKit lifecycle controls.

The game uses only procedural canvas art, has no accounts or network gameplay services, and keeps device-local best score exclusively through GameKit.
